<section class="workspace-flow review-flow workspace-panel" id="flow-review" aria-labelledby="tracker-ui-h">

  <div class="sx-card shortlist-search">
    <footer class="sx-foot">
      <label class="search-profile"><input type="checkbox" id="search-use-profile" disabled> Score new jobs against my profile files <small id="search-ai-hint">Needs an AI provider in .env and your uploaded student files.</small></label>
      <div class="sx-actions">
        <button class="btn btn--primary" id="btn-start-search" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass" aria-hidden="true"></i> Search new postings</button>
      </div>
    </footer>
    <div class="sx-run">
      <p id="search-run-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">One search covers every IT internship in Germany, in German and English, from free job sources, from LinkedIn and other boards through an NVIDIA NIM model (search APIs only, no Claude tokens), and from Indeed, StepStone and Arbeitsagentur through your Claude account's connectors. Each internship shows which of them found it, and you can filter by it. It adds only internships posted in the last 7 days that the GJU rules do not rule out: 20 weeks to 6 months, in Germany. Pay and language level do not count against a posting. With AI scoring on, it also leaves out what scores under 10. Your notes and decisions stay with each job.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

