<section class="workspace-utility workspace-panel" id="flow-insights" aria-labelledby="analytics-h">
<details class="workspace-tools" id="insights" open>
  <summary><span>Application insights</span><small>What your tracker says about where to go next</small></summary>
  <div class="utility-content">
  <h2 id="analytics-h">Your insights</h2>
  <p class="lede">Drawn from your own tracker, your profile skills and the GJU rules. Nothing leaves your computer.</p>
  <p id="insights-empty" class="notice-empty">Your first application unlocks these charts. Add one in the workbook above, and this page starts showing you where to focus.</p>
  <div class="grid-2 chart-grid" id="insights-grid" hidden>
    <div class="card chart-card chart-card--wide" id="card-gates" hidden>
      <h3>Each posting against the GJU minimums</h3>
      <p class="muted">Percent above (green) or below (red) the line: 20 weeks, and the monthly pay needed for a visa extension.</p>
      <div id="chart-gates" class="chart-container"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card chart-card" id="card-quadrant" hidden>
      <h3>Where to spend your effort</h3>
      <p class="muted">Match score across, pay up. Top right is the place to apply first.</p>
      <div id="chart-quadrant" class="chart-container"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card chart-card" id="card-skills" hidden>
      <h3>Skills postings ask for</h3>
      <p class="muted"><span class="key key--have"></span> You have it &nbsp; <span class="key key--gap"></span> A gap to close with <code>/upskill</code></p>
      <div id="chart-skills" class="chart-container"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card chart-card" id="card-dates" hidden>
      <h3>Coming up</h3>
      <p class="muted"><span class="key" style="background:#F87171"></span> Deadline &nbsp; <span class="key" style="background:#38BDF8"></span> Follow-up &nbsp; <span class="key" style="background:#34D399"></span> Interview. The next two weeks; overdue ones sit at day 0.</p>
      <div id="chart-dates" class="chart-container"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card chart-card" id="card-sources" hidden>
      <h3>Which sources get replies</h3>
      <p class="muted">Where each source's postings ended up. <span id="legend-sources"></span></p>
      <div id="chart-sources" class="chart-container"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card chart-card" id="card-tally" hidden>
      <h3>Effort, counted</h3>
      <p class="muted">One mark for each thing you did. Every one counts.</p>
      <div id="chart-tally" class="chart-container"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card chart-card chart-card--wide" id="card-calendar" hidden>
      <h3>The days you sent applications</h3>
      <div id="chart-calendar" class="chart-container chart-container--short"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  </div>
</details>
</section>
